# HakiOS fragment: the Qualcomm SM8550 family (Snapdragon 8 Gen 2, "kalama") -- what is true of the SoC, whatever device it is in.
# Eight cores: 0-2 Cortex-A510, 3-6 Cortex-A715/A710, 7 the Cortex-X3, the biggest (Linux's sm8550.dtsi, cpu-map).
# The SoC's own drivers (cpufreq, thermal, socinfo, pmic) were written against SC7280's addresses and are NOT turned on here
# yet: each comes back once its block has been checked against this SoC's tree (docs/porting/index.md, step 3, order 1).
CONFIG_SOC="sm8550"
CONFIG_CPUS=8
CONFIG_BOOTCPU=7
